From the ground around you, you form living stone vines extending from your feet.

Each turn, the vines will attempt to seize a random target within radius [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)].

Affected creatures are pinned to the ground and take [29, 38, 45, 50, 55 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] nature damage each turn for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

A creature entangled by the vines will have a chance to break free each turn, and will automatically succeed if it is more than [8, 9, 9, 10, 10 (TL1-5)] grids away from you.

The chance to affect targets and damage increase with talent level and Willpower.
